050-2026.05-mustang/PixelSpoof.apk", "size": 71584, "downloadCount": 1546}]}, {"tagName": "102026040-2026.04-mustang", "name": "MustangSpoof", "createdAt": "2026-04-11T10:02:59Z", "body": "Pixel 10 Pro XL (mustang) spoof\r\n16.0.0 (CP1A.260405.005, Apr 2026)", "assets": [{"name": "PixelSpoof.apk", "downloadUrl": "https://github.com/Xposed-Modules-Repo/org.klab.pixelspoof/releases/download/102026040-2026.04-mustang/PixelSpoof.apk", "size": 72384, "downloadCount": 1935}]}], "contributors": ["klab7"], "readme": "# PixelSpoof\n\n## Description\nAn LSPosed module that lets you spoof all device-specific properties of your device, selectively for individual apps, to a high end Pixel device. \nCurrently Pixel 11 Pro XL (kodiak).\n\n## Installation\n1. Install the APK.\n2. Enable the **PixelSpoof** module in **LSPosed Manager**.\n3. Select the apps you need in module's scope.\n4. Restart the selected apps.\n\n## Features\n* Build.prop values from latest Pixel 11 Pro XL official firmware.\n* Features xmls from Pixel 11 series.\n", "readmeZh": "# 像素欺骗\n\n## 说明\nLSPosed 模块可让您将设备的所有特定于设备的属性（有选择地针对单个应用程序）欺骗到高端 Pixel 设备。 \n目前是 Pixel 11 Pro XL (kodiak)。\n\n## 安装\n1.安装APK。\n2. 在 **LSPosed Manager** 中启用 **PixelSpoof** 模块。\n3. 在模块范围中选择您需要的应​​用程序。\n4. 重新启动选定的应用程序。\n\n## 特点\n* Build.prop 值来自最新的 Pixel 11 Pro XL 官方固件。\n* 采用 Pixel 11 系列的 xml。"}